---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="Workshop: Entrepreneurial Frequency 33 | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="Tools from Ontic Numerology to give direction and frequency to your business purpose.">
	<Header />
	
	<!-- Header Section -->
	<header class="page-header pattern-bg">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="header-content text-center">
				<span class="brand-subtitle">Human Development & Numerology</span>
				<h1 class="text-gradient-gold">WORKSHOP: ENTREPRENEURIAL FREQUENCY 33</h1>
				<p class="lead">"Tools from Ontic Numerology to frequency and direct your business purpose."</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main class="taller-main">
		<section class="section">
			<div class="container level-grid">
				
				<!-- Information Column -->
				<div class="level-info">
					<div class="content-card glass-panel">
						<h2>Workshop Overview</h2>
						<p>
							Behind every great venture lies a frequency that sustains it. Every project is born from an idea, but it solidifies into earthly reality through its identity (its name) and its physical or digital coordinates (its location).
						</p>
						<p>
							Whether you are about to launch a project or seeking to unblock growth in your current business, this workshop provides tools from Ontic Numerology to align your company's energy with sustainable, conscious success.
						</p>
						
						<h3>What will we resolve in this practical masterclass?</h3>
						<ul class="temario-list">
							<li><i class="icon-star"></i> <strong>1. Vibrational Identity:</strong> What should I name my project? You will learn how to calculate and select a business name possessing the ideal numerical frequency to attract your ideal client and mirror the authentic essence of your brand.</li>
							<li><i class="icon-star"></i> <strong>2. Territorial Anchoring:</strong> Which location or address should I choose to launch? We will analyze how the numbers of a street, commercial premise, or office alter sales velocity and productivity.</li>
							<li><i class="icon-star"></i> <strong>3. Frequency Audit:</strong> How does my current address help me? If you already own premises or work from home, we assess the vibration of your current address and how it impacts your operations.</li>
							<li><i class="icon-star"></i> <strong>4. Harmonization Tools:</strong> We deliver precise ontic methodologies to correct, neutralize, or boost the frequency of your current brand name and address, opening new channels of expansion and stability.</li>
						</ul>
                        
                        <h3>Who is this for?</h3>
                        <p>
                            Entrepreneurs at the idea stage who wish to be born with a solid commercial and frequential structure.<br/><br/>
                            Business owners with active ventures who feel sales have stagnated or that the energy in their commercial space feels heavy or unstable.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div class="alert-box">
                            <p><em>"No prior knowledge in numerology is required; the methodology is taught practically from foundational principles."</em></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alert-box" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                            <p><em>"Certification: A certificate of participation issued by the Primigenias 33 School of Ontic Sciences is awarded."</em></p>
                        </div>
					</div>
				</div>
                
                <!-- Details and Dates Sidebar Column -->
				<div class="level-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card glass-panel breathing-glow">
						<img src="/images/frecuencia-emprendedora.png" alt="Entrepreneurial Frequency Workshop" class="media-img" />
                        
                        <div class="image-box" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top: 1rem;">
                            <img src="/images/omar.png" alt="Omar Zambrano" class="media-img" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;" />
                            <span class="img-caption" style="display: block; text-align: center; color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 0.9rem;">Omar Zambrano - Instructor & Founder</span>
                        </div>
						
						<div class="details-list">
							<div class="detail-item">
								<span class="detail-label">Duration:</span>
								<span class="detail-value">2 hours in total (divided into 1 session).</span>
							</div>
							<div class="detail-item">
								<span class="detail-label">Modality:</span>
								<span class="detail-value">Live Online (via Zoom) / Recorded with virtual campus access.</span>
							</div>
							<div class="detail-item">
								<span class="detail-label">Includes:</span>
								<span class="detail-value">Class recordings and complementary PDF reading materials.</span>
							</div>
                            <div class="detail-item">
								<span class="detail-label">Spots:</span>
								<span class="detail-value">Limited to guarantee practical focus and direct case reviews.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
                        
                        <div class="action-box">
                            <h4 style="color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Begin your training today</h4>
                            <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Inquiries & Registration</a>
                            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a1a1aa; margin-top: 1rem; text-align: center;">Start date and investment: Inquire via WhatsApp +51 967747483</p>
                        </div>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>
        
	</main>
	
	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header { padding: 8rem 1rem 3.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
	.header-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
	.brand-subtitle { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	.page-header h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; line-height: 1.2; }
	.lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; }
	.level-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; gap: 3rem; padding: 3rem 0; }
	.content-card { padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.content-card h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #fff; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .content-card h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--accent-gold); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	.content-card p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
	.temario-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
	.temario-list li { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold); color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .alert-box { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .alert-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--accent-gold); }
	.sidebar-card { padding: 2rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); position: sticky; top: 100px; }
	.media-img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .details-list { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .detail-item { margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    .detail-label { display: block; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .detail-value { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; display: block; }
    .action-box { text-align: center; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
        .level-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .sidebar-card { position: relative; top: 0; }
    }
</style>
